From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: perfectra1n <jonfuller2012@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 23 Sep 2026 12:11:56 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 1/4] feat(act): add a gRPC client for out-of-process backend
 plugins

A backend plugin owns the job's execution environment (a Kubernetes pod,
a VM, ...) and the runner drives it over the plugin.v1alpha protocol,
which is wire-compatible with Forgejo runner's backend plugins. The
client uses connect's gRPC protocol over h2c, so no new module is needed.

